    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The ice age, Father's shop, and the Sunfire stone...&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An endless winter grips the world. With a long winter of unknown causes, many people die from hunger and cold. This disaster is called the 'Last Winter'. After receiving a letter, Will returns to his hometown of Arbyen. He takes over his father's shop and runs it in his absence.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/8fc19ead1acc8ce86a5e7661b183b961.poster.avif?t=1748802697\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/8fc19ead1acc8ce86a5e7661b183b961.webm?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/8fc19ead1acc8ce86a5e7661b183b961.mp4?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Farming : Survive from the Cold&quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has become too cold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get fuel and food, you have to go out and fight against the cold, snowstorms, and wild animals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/becc0f5f9c82d5f722f65aa28d8b6b2b.poster.avif?t=1748802697\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/becc0f5f9c82d5f722f65aa28d8b6b2b.webm?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/becc0f5f9c82d5f722f65aa28d8b6b2b.mp4?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Management : Run your father's shop&quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store is a perfect place for enduring colder nights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need to keep the furnace from going out, and the food from running out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/a98628e8ca55799ce399776ae7a8c343.poster.avif?t=1748802697\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/a98628e8ca55799ce399776ae7a8c343.webm?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/a98628e8ca55799ce399776ae7a8c343.mp4?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Exploration : Chase the missing father and the Sunfire stone&quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many resources and secrets hidden in the mining town of 'Arbyen'.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore more forests and underground areas, and follow the trail of father and the Sunfire stone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/7303289413783b244cd1a67c4eb3ab94.poster.avif?t=1748802697\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/7303289413783b244cd1a67c4eb3ab94.webm?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/7303289413783b244cd1a67c4eb3ab94.mp4?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Interaction : Communicate with various characters&quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with various characters, including your father's old coworkers, the merchant organization, government officials, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their hearts are frozen like a cold winter, but you can gradually get closer to their true feelings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/d28a60f099ef7fb3fc93ac3cb90591e4.poster.avif?t=1748802697\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/d28a60f099ef7fb3fc93ac3cb90591e4.webm?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/d28a60f099ef7fb3fc93ac3cb90591e4.mp4?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
