3289413783b244cd1a67c4eb3ab94.mp4?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Interaction : Communicate with various characters&quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with various characters, including your father's old coworkers, the merchant organization, government officials, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their hearts are frozen like a cold winter, but you can gradually get closer to their true feelings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/d28a60f099ef7fb3fc93ac3cb90591e4.poster.avif?t=1748802697\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/d28a60f099ef7fb3fc93ac3cb90591e4.webm?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666750/extras/d28a60f099ef7fb3fc93ac3cb90591e4.mp4?t=1748802697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
